WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
 It deleted Zendesk and I did my own ticket system.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.500
 So I have my local Mac Mini that copies my database because I don't want

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.560
 it active in the actual database.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.620
 So it does a pull request, updates the database once per hour, and I can just

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.920
 say, see ticket five, number five, and read it, and it looks up the tickets

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.480
 in my database and it knows the exact conversation and the issue and it knows

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.000
 what to do.

